  "description": "An ordered list of SequenceAction pattern steps. Each entry is either a single InputChannel (a one-channel step) or a nested InputChord (several channels required together for that one step) — the array-form equivalent of a `'>'`-separated, `'+'`-joined string pattern such as `'Down>Down+Right>Right'`.",
